		<title type="html"><![CDATA[Release Candidate 1 Version 2024 07 14]]></title>

		
		<content type="html" xml:base="http://localhost/opengd77/viewtopic.php?t=4238&amp;p=32101#p32101"><![CDATA[
A Release Candidate 1 version of the firmware is now available.<br><br>This version will hopefully become the stable Release version for this half of the year.<br><br>There are no functional changes between this version and the last Beta. <br>The only changes were that some redundant code has been removed by Daniel F1RMB and that the development environment, compiler and SDK has been updated to the latest version.<br><br>See.<br><br><br><a href="https://www.opengd77.com/downloads/MD9600/Firmware/0c885b34e52cca7e946d82a4881bb211cb488e61" class="postlink">downloads/MD9600/Firmware/0c885b34e52cc ... 11cb488e61</a><br><br><a href="https://www.opengd77.com/downloads/MD9600/Firmware/Latest" class="postlink">downloads/MD9600/Firmware/Latest</a><br><br><br>If no new bugs are reported by the end of July, then this version will become the stable release version and the stable source code will be released<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=50">VK3KYY</a> — Sun Jul 14, 2024 8:04 am</p><hr />
